%% Title: Collection cycle · part 3 of 3 · cycle close, bias checks, embeddings, alerts
%% Summary: How a collection cycle's job is closed and its job-level bias checks run once, how embeddings and scoring retries are processed, and how alerts reach the page.
%% Sources: src/workers/start.js (closeDueCycles, every 30 s), src/collectors/cycle.js, src/collectors/sweep.js, src/pipeline/bias.js, src/workers/{ingest,embed}.worker.js, src/pipeline/embeddings.js, python/embeddings_service.py, src/routes/{health,bias}.js, public/js/{main,ui,utils}.js. Spec: TECHNICAL_SPEC.md sections 9 (bias monitoring, alert flow), 12 (embeddings).
flowchart LR

  subgraph CLOSE["Cycle close · worker timer every 30 s"]
    direction TB
    C1["29 · claimDueCycles(): FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED,<br/>status → closing, for every cron job whose window<br/>+ 60 s grace has passed with inflight_runs ≤ 0<br/>(or past the hard cap max(15 min, 4 × window)),<br/>and every awaiting_retries job whose retries are done"]:::done
    C2["30 · posts = COUNT(DISTINCT raw_post_id)<br/>in decision_audit_log for the job"]:::done
    C3{"posts #gt; 0?"}:::done
    C4["31 · runBiasChecks(job, bias@1.1.0), once:<br/>location_concentration ·<br/>platform_sentiment_parity · negative_dominance<br/>→ 3 bias_assessments rows with methodology_version_id"]:::done
    C5["32 · each violation → one alert_events row<br/>(alert_type = the check, severity warning / critical)"]:::done
    C6["33 · job completed with posts_processed;<br/>on error → failed, error text scrubbed"]:::done
    C1 --> C2 --> C3
    C3 -- yes --> C4 --> C5 --> C6
    C3 -- no --> C6
  end

  subgraph OTHER["Refresh, standup and manual jobs"]
    direction TB
    J1["POST /api/refresh (triggered_by api),<br/>populate --once (standup), npm run collect (manual):<br/>one job over every source; bias checks at the<br/>end of the run, or status awaiting_retries<br/>until its reserved scoring retries finish"]:::done
  end

  subgraph SWEEP["Retries and sweep"]
